Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Barbie and the Magic of Reading",
  "author": "Barbie",
  "year": 2026
}

###

PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Barbie Dream Library",
  "author": "Barbie",
  "year": 2025
