###

DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/5

###   Test Post/Redirect/Get
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Java Precisely&author=Sestoft&year=2016
### 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/by-year/abc

### 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999

### 405 Method Not Allowed
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 406 Not Acceptable
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: application/xml

### 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: text/plain

hello

### Variant 2 - Valid year
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/by-year/2018

### Variant 2 - Invalid year (letters)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/by-year/abc

### Variant 2 - Invalid year (2 digits)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/by-year/22

### 400 Bad Request - Invalid limit
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?limit=abc

